    { '@type': 'Question', name: 'What if the teeth are dull when I pick up the rental?', acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: "Ask the counter to swap or sharpen them before you leave, or ask for a different machine. If they can't, a small-engine grinder with dull teeth will polish a hardwood stump instead of cutting it, and the day can end with the stump still in the ground." } },
